      "id": "claim_b84ca73fa9ca440eaddd035980a5842f",
      "statement": "A thread’s durable sandbox binding is `sandbox_id` in thread metadata, while `SANDBOX_BACKENDS` is a worker-local map of stable per-thread proxies; metadata lookup accepts inline metadata with a string ID or reads the live thread, and a failed live lookup propagates rather than being treated as unbound.",
